 "name_en": "Omnichannel Convergent Billing (1MC)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Omnichannel Convergent Billing (1MC)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio830d518c18af455dbb1d1400e2ce39f0\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio830d518c18af455dbb1d1400e2ce39f0__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item for sales billing enables billable data sent from multiple channels (internal and external) to be combined into a single customer invoice.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">After receiving billable data from external channels, the system carries it forward in the form of external billing document requests.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables the creation of billing documents in the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> system by using billable data received from an external system, received from an external system and internal data from a sell-from-stock process, or received from an external system and internal data from project-based services. Billing documents can also be created by combining billable data received from an external system with data from a sell-from-stock process and a project-based services process, or using external data imported into the system from a spreadsheet file.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio830d518c18af455dbb1d1400e2ce39f0__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billing documents using external billing data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billing documents using data from Professional Services and external billing data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billing documents using data from Sell from Stock and external billing data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billing documents using data from Sell from Stock, Professional Services, and external billing data</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio830d518c18af455dbb1d1400e2ce39f0__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce administrative effort of managing billing document requests from multiple streams</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create clear consolidated billing documents to be sent to customers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide one legal billing document for all services, subscriptions, projects, products, and expenses (including external data)</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>全渠道集中开票 (1MC)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio830d518c18af455dbb1d1400e2ce39f0\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio830d518c18af455dbb1d1400e2ce39f0__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此销售开票范围项目允许将从多个渠道（内部和外部）发送的可开票数据合并到单个客户发票中。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">从外部渠道接收可开票数据后，系统会以外部开票凭证请求的形式进行结转。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目允许使用从外部系统接收的可开票数据、从外部系统接收的可开票数据和从按库存销售流程接收的内部数据，或从外部系统接收的可开票数据和从基于项目的服务接收的内部数据，在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 系统中创建开票凭证。还可以通过将从外部系统接收的可开票数据与来自按库存销售流程和基于项目的服务流程的数据相结合，或使用从电子表格文件导入到系统中的外部数据来创建开票凭证。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio830d518c18af455dbb1d1400e2ce39f0__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用外部开票数据创建开票凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用专业服务和外部开票数据中的数据创建开票凭证。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用“从库存销售”数据和外部开票数据创建开票凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用从库存销售、专业服务和外部开票数据中创建开票凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio830d518c18af455dbb1d1400e2ce39f0__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">减少管理来自多个流的开票凭证请求的管理工作量。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建要发送给客户的清晰合并开票凭证。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为所有服务、订阅、项目、产品和费用（包括外部数据）提供一个法定开票凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
